{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_9\">Problem 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the result of doubling both the base and exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8be4a03400384a2719b865cf815f46d4f857be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> does not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. \nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> equals the product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8be4a03400384a2719b865cf815f46d4f857be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33fd8a6d8c23b70a0ccf61d45022f18ba82bcc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^b$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/8/6c8cbf5ade21b2aaf9677ca60f86e420b03292c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2a \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4a \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"369\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the problem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/6/7c616a3c18711ef203d0a549f9b6237201093037.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = (2a)^{2b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/a/75a10b5a21e23f08bab3874b295fc1479a749ea8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2a)^{2b} = a^b \\cdot x^b\\]\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c5ad8b4a949d81c868aa2b52980c41be9cd3277.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(4a^2)^b = (ax)^b\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/3/0238badcc2410594bab9da515d4d4d32b79148f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a^2 = ax\\]\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/a/2baf190c183b951cd39eb54e1294ea51e6d7ac59.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 4a\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\nThus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Doubling both the base and exponent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/8/3a8be4a03400384a2719b865cf815f46d4f857be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^b$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/6/ab66825efe3d8a0ccb2c2f42ba034f409ed1c88a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=(2a)^{2b}=(4a^2)^b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"22\" />\nBut the problem also writes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/61005da2e53ef707c3c5cdc00877422c306c3382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=a^bx^b=(ax)^b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"22\" />. Hence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7d68cbc37f301e936d93a5145b50025c53c461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4a^2)^b=(ax)^b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"22\" />\nFor the positive quantities involved, the bases are equal, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b125201c5e2d16be19060d85b63c70d7a8592bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2=ax\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\qquad x=4a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"236\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_